license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/YOUR-ORG/anchormap"
abstract: >
  Surface, interface and support-compatibility analysis for immobilising
  multimeric enzymes. Computes assembly-state solvent accessibility, coupling
  site maps with active-site exclusions, multipoint crosslinker reachability,
  subunit interface energetics with convergence reporting, and support
  charge compatibility. Preconditions encode failure modes observed during
  development.
keywords:
  - enzyme immobilisation
  - protein interfaces
  - solvent accessibility
  - structural biology
